 "d20": "<header class=\"controls panel\"><h1>Rolador de dados</h1><div class=\"selection\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Dados\"><div class=\"pick\"><button aria-label=\"Adicionar d4\" aria-pressed=\"false\">d4</button></div><div class=\"pick\"><button aria-label=\"Adicionar d6\" aria-pressed=\"false\">d6</button></div><div class=\"pick\"><button aria-label=\"Adicionar d8\" aria-pressed=\"false\">d8</button></div><div class=\"pick\"><button aria-label=\"Adicionar d10\" aria-pressed=\"false\">d10</button></div><div class=\"pick\"><button aria-label=\"Adicionar d12\" aria-pressed=\"false\">d12</button></div><div class=\"pick\"><button aria-label=\"Adicionar d20\" aria-pressed=\"true\">1d20</button><button class=\"remove\" aria-label=\"Remover d20\" disabled=\"\">−</button></div><div class=\"pick\"><button aria-label=\"Adicionar d100\" aria-pressed=\"false\">d100</button></div><div class=\"pick\"><button aria-label=\"Adicionar d10 Vampiro\" aria-pressed=\"false\">d10 Vampiro</button></div><div class=\"pick\"><button aria-label=\"Adicionar d10 Fome\" aria-pressed=\"false\">d10 Fome</button></div><div class=\"pick\"><button aria-label=\"Adicionar d6 Fogo\" aria-pressed=\"false\">d6 Fogo</button></div><div class=\"pick\"><button aria-label=\"Adicionar Moeda\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Moeda</button></div></div><div class=\"selection\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Meus dados\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"import-die\">Importar dado</button></div><p class=\"pool\" aria-live=\"polite\">1d20</p><button class=\"chat-toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"dice-chat\" aria-keyshortcuts=\"C\">Chat <kbd>C</kbd></button><aside id=\"dice-chat\" class=\"chat panel\" data-open=\"false\" inert=\"\" aria-label=\"Chat de dados\"><header><h2>Chat de dados</h2><button aria-label=\"Fechar chat\">×</button></header><ol class=\"chat-log\" aria-live=\"polite\"><li class=\"hint\">Escreva os dados e aperte Enter. Ex.: <code>2d10 + d100</code> ou <code>2d10d100d4</code>. Dados especiais: <code>2d10v + 1d10fome</code> (Vampiro), <code>bola de fogo</code> (8d6 de fogo) e os seus dados importados (ex.: <code>2d20caveira</code>).</li></ol><form><input aria-label=\"Dados, por exemplo 2d10 + d100\" placeholder=\"2d10 + d100\" autoComplete=\"off\" spellCheck=\"false\" value=\"\"/><button type=\"submit\">Aplicar</button></form></aside><button class=\"chat-toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"table-panel\" aria-keyshortcuts=\"M\">Mesa <kbd>M</kbd></button><aside id=\"table-panel\" class=\"chat panel import table-panel\" data-open=\"false\" inert=\"\" aria-label=\"Personalizar mesa\"><header><h2>Personalizar mesa</h2><button aria-label=\"Fechar painel da mesa\">×</button></header><div class=\"import-body\"><fieldset><legend>Fundo</legend><div class=\"import-row\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Tipo de fundo\"><button aria-pressed=\"true\">Cor</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\">Foto</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\">360°</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\">Tema</button><input id=\"table-panorama\" data-testid=\"table-panorama\" type=\"file\" hidden=\"\" accept=\".jpg,.jpeg,.png,.webp,.hdr,image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp\"/><input id=\"table-photo\" data-testid=\"table-photo\" type=\"file\" accept=\"image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp\" hidden=\"\"/></div><label class=\"table-row\">Cor do fundo<input type=\"color\" value=\"#140E10\"/></label></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Mesa</legend><label class=\"table-row\">Feltro<input type=\"color\" value=\"#3A0F1A\"/></label><label class=\"table-row\">Madeira<input type=\"color\" value=\"#3B2416\"/></label><label class=\"table-row\">Textura do feltro<select><option value=\"liso\" selected=\"\">Liso</option><option value=\"veludo\">Veludo</option><option value=\"couro\">Couro</option><option value=\"imagem\">Minha imagem…</option></select></label><input id=\"table-felt-image\" data-testid=\"table-felt-image\" type=\"file\" accept=\"image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp\" hidden=\"\"/></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Arquivo</legend><label class=\"table-row\">Nome da mesa <input maxLength=\"40\" disabled=\"\" value=\"Mesa padrão\"/></label><div class=\"import-row\"><button>Exportar mesa</button><button>Importar mesa</button><input id=\"table-import\" data-testid=\"table-import\" type=\"file\" accept=\".glb,model/gltf-binary\" hidden=\"\"/><button disabled=\"\">Duplicar mesa</button><button disabled=\"\">Restaurar mesa padrão</button></div><small>Só .glb (até 20 MB, 100 mil triângulos, texturas de 2048 px). A mesa só muda o visual: a física e os resultados não mudam.</small></fieldset></div></aside></header>",
